{{Setting|'''Leave list items enabled'''|Causes items in the list to be left in an enabled state to allow user interaction directly with the item.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Background color'''|Specifies the color of the list background.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Highlight color'''|If checked, specifies the color of the highlight used to indicate selected items, overriding the default highlight color specified by the &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;$hiliteColor&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; system variable.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Focus glow color'''|If checked, specifies the color of the glow drawn around the list box when it has the keyboard focus, overriding the default glow color given by the &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;$hiliteColor&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; system variable multiplied by 5/8.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Text item font'''|Determines what font is used to display plain text list items.}}&lt;br /&gt;
